1. Scope
   This license covers the WCH Configurator: index.html, the desktop/,
   hwtest/ and .github/ folders, the documentation (README files) and every
   data table collected for this project (pinouts, pin functions, clock trees,
   chip specifications, electrical limits) - together "the Software".
   Files that come from WCH (the Drivers/ and Templates/ folders, and the WCH
   EVT code a generated project downloads) keep their own licenses.

2. What you may do
   a. Use the Software, as the web page or the desktop app, free of charge,
      for personal, educational and commercial work.
   b. Use the output. The code and projects the Software generates for you
      are yours: you may use, change, sell and publish them without
      restriction, including in commercial products.
   c. Read the source code, and fork the repository on GitHub with GitHub's
      own fork function only to the extent the GitHub Terms of Service
      require it, and only to send changes back to the original repository as
      pull requests.
   d. Download the releases from the original repository or from the release
      pages it links to.

